        "12. A single-phase full-wave bridge rectifier is powered from a 230 V, 50 Hz mains line through a 10:1 step-down transformer. Neglecting diode barrier drops: (a) Calculate the peak secondary voltage V_m, (b) Compute the average DC output voltage V_dc, (c) Determine the RMS output voltage V_rms, and (d) Evaluate the DC power delivered to a 150 Ω load resistor.",
